Build a proof-of-concept for SkinSage, an AI skincare consultant. The goal is to demonstrate the full loop: photo → skin analysis → conversational profile building → RAG-based product recommendation. No auth, no database, no deployment — everything runs locally.

## Stack
- Python 3.11+
- FastAPI + Pydantic v2
- OpenAI Python SDK (GPT-4o for chat, GPT-4o Vision for image analysis)
- ChromaDB (in-memory, no persistence needed)
- python-dotenv for the API key

