### main.py
FastAPI app with CORS enabled for all origins (POC only).

Endpoints:

POST /analyze
- Body: AnalysisRequest (image_base64)
- Calls vision_service.analyze_skin_photo()
- Returns the SkinProfile JSON
- Also initializes a session opening message from SkinSage acknowledging what it observed

POST /chat
- Body: ChatRequest (conversation_history, skin_profile, user_message)
- Calls rag_service.retrieve_relevant_products() with current skin_profile
- Calls conversation_service.get_next_response()
- If is_ready_to_recommend is True: call a recommend() function that formats the retrieved_context into 3 clean RecommendationResponse objects and returns them alongside the assistant response
- Returns: { assistant_response, updated_skin_profile, recommendations (list, empty until ready), is_complete (bool) }

GET /health
- Returns { status: ok }

On startup: initialize the Chroma collection by loading and embedding all knowledge base files.

