### Knowledge Base Files

Write realistic, detailed content for each file. Each product file should include:
- Product name, brand, ASIN, price range
- Routine step (cleanser/moisturizer/serum/spf/treatment) and time (morning/evening/both)
- Key ingredients with brief explanation of what each does
- Skin types it works for
- Monk tones it works for and any specific notes for deeper skin tones (e.g. SPF white cast)
- Whether fragrance free and cruelty free
- Why it works (ingredient science, not marketing language)
- What it is NOT good for

Each ingredient file should include:
- What the ingredient does at a cellular/skin level
- Effective concentration range
- How it behaves differently on deeper skin tones if relevant
- What it pairs well with and what it conflicts with
- Any sensitization or overuse risks

Use real, currently available products with real ASINs. Products should span a range of price points ($8–$40) and be available on Amazon.

