### frontend/index.html

Single HTML file, no frameworks, no build step. Inline CSS and JS only.

Layout:
- Header: "SkinSage — AI Skincare Consultant (POC)"
- Left panel: photo upload area (file input + preview of uploaded image) and an "Analyze Skin" button
- Right panel: chat interface — scrollable message history, text input, send button
- Below chat: recommendations panel (hidden until recommendations arrive) — shows product cards with name, brand, why recommended, key ingredients, and a placeholder Amazon link using the ASIN

Flow:
1. User uploads photo and clicks Analyze
2. JS sends image as base64 to POST /analyze
3. Response triggers first SkinSage message in chat: "I can see [what was observed]. Let me ask you a few questions..."
4. User types responses, JS sends to POST /chat with full conversation history and current skin_profile
5. Chat updates with each turn
6. When is_complete is true, recommendation cards appear below the chat
7. Show a loading spinner during any API call

Style: clean, minimal, white background, soft sage green (#7A9E7E) as accent color, Inter or system font, mobile-friendly width.

